# AlphaForge Founder OS

Follow `AGENTS.md` as the source of truth.

First job: reduce the biggest startup uncertainty with the cheapest credible experiment.

Before any Feature: Which hypothesis does this test? If unanswered, DO NOT BUILD.

Do not build Web App, Dashboard, Login, Payment, Marketplace, or complex infrastructure in this stage.

Update `daily/`, `ASSUMPTIONS.md`, `DECISIONS.md`, and `TOOLCHAIN.md` when evidence changes.

Use `/start-day` and `/end-day`.
